---
code: host-evidence-admission-refused
when-fires: bounded host evidence failed closed admission before entering the decision plane.
why: host evidence remains controller-owned and decision-inert until admission succeeds.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh
error[host-evidence-admission-refused]: Dorc refused this attempt's probe
records before using them: the stream failed an admission check (framing, size,
structure, or identity), so none of it became a fact and no plan was produced.
